text.section:
Each group accident and sickness insurance policy shall contain a provision that the insurer will issue to the policyholder for delivery to each person insured a certificate setting forth:

The insured person's insurance protection, including any limitations, reductions, and exclusions applicable to the coverage provided;


To whom the insurance benefits are payable;


Any family member's or dependent's coverage; and


The rights and conditions set forth in § 38.2-3541.
